---
import Arrow from "../Arrow.astro";
---

<section class="belief" data-track>
  <div class="page">
    <p class="tag" data-reveal><span class="idx">01</span> Why foundations</p>

    <!-- The thesis, at scale. Type is the image here. -->
    <p class="thesis d1 lines">
      <span><span style="--ld:0ms"><b>Inkingi</b> is Kinyarwanda for</span></span>
      <span><span style="--ld:90ms"><em>pillar</em>. A pillar is not</span></span>
      <span><span style="--ld:180ms">decoration. It is the thing</span></span>
      <span><span style="--ld:270ms">everything else rests on.</span></span>
    </p>

    <div class="two">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="rule body">
          Most technology sold on this continent is disposable. A template
          rebranded as a platform. A project abandoned the week after launch.
          A vendor who stops answering once the invoice clears. The real cost
          is not the money — it is the three years a business spends operating
          on something that cannot carry it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="--rd:120ms">
        <p class="rule body">
          A digital foundation behaves differently. It automates the work that
          drains your people. It shows you the operation as it actually is,
          today, not at month end. And it holds weight when you double in size,
          because it was engineered to.
        </p>
        <a href="/approach" class="tlink more">
          How we work
          <Arrow />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .belief {
    padding-block: var(--band-vast) var(--band);
  }

  .thesis {
    margin-block: var(--s-6) var(--s-9);
    max-inline-size: 22ch;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: var(--tr-hero);
    line-height: 1.04;
  }
  .thesis b {
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--emerald-2);
  }
  .thesis em {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 900;
    /* the word itself is annotated, like a term being defined */
    position: relative;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .thesis em::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset-inline: -0.06em;
    inset-block-end: 0.1em;
    block-size: 0.075em;
    background: var(--emerald);
    /* draws in as the section is scrolled through */
    transform: scaleX(clamp(0, calc((var(--p, 0) - 0.28) * 3.6), 1));
    transform-origin: left;
  }

  .two {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-7);
    max-inline-size: 62rem;
    margin-inline-start: auto;
  }
  .two .body {
    max-inline-size: 44ch;
  }
  .more {
    margin-block-start: var(--s-5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .two {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--s-6);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .thesis em::after {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }
  }
</style>
